\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::1><$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Drone display\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The main swarm arrives spectacularly.\
The display should be 
\f1\b \strokec2 compressed
\f2\b0 \strokec2 , rather than proceeding laboriously through one celebrity at a time. Multiple giant images can appear simultaneously, transform in banks, overlap, or sweep across the swarm.\
The list of Australian personalities currently in the scene notes remains available as material for this compressed display.\
One or two recognitions can carry the comedy\'97particularly the possibility of a perfectly rendered historical celebrity whom nobody present can identify any more.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f6\b\fs26 \cf0 \strokec2 You'll Never Walk Alone
\f1\fs24 \strokec2  remains a live idea
\f2\b0 \strokec2 , not committed but potentially useful. It could become part of the Elvi collective response without requiring a separate extended musical set-piece.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Offensive pentads\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Not every drone necessarily carries a Gyges disc.\
The 
\f1\b \strokec2 offensive MoSES drones do
\f2\b0 \strokec2 .\
They peel away from the main illuminated swarm in groups of 
\f1\b \strokec2 five
\f2\b0 \strokec2 , switching their lights off.\
Each five-drone unit is a 
\f1\b \strokec2 pentad
\f2\b0 \strokec2 .\
The pentad deliberately resembles the 
\f1\b \strokec2 pentagonal/pentagram geometry of the mature Project Kebab apparatus
\f2\b0 \strokec2 , a configuration seeded well before the climax when the Sages put that geometry into Johnny's head.\
Each drone in an offensive pentad carries a Gyges disc.\
A pentad controls:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the exact three-dimensional position of its five drones relative to the target;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the exact relative geometry of the five Gyges discs;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 precisely coordinated disc rotation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 That allows it to induce 
\f1\b \strokec2 controlled shaking within a tightly defined three-dimensional volume
\f2\b0 \strokec2 .\
This is not a new class of phenomenon. It is Fridge Force demonstrating controlled mastery of phenomena that Gyges discs have produced erratically throughout the novel: local disturbances, distant seismic effects, bizarre thawing and other spatially displaced consequences.\
The revelation is 
\f1\b \strokec2 control
\f2\b0 \strokec2 , not a new magical property.\
Each pentad is autonomous and can choose its own objective independently of the main swarm and of other pentads.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

