\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 weapons;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 vehicles;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 communications/support equipment;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 checkpoints;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 fortified or forward positions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 A pentad surrounds or geometrically brackets a target.\
Then the carefully bounded volume containing that target begins shaking violently.\
This allows Fridge Force to dismantle the UDF position without requiring an ordinary exchange of missiles and gunfire.\
The precise opening trigger of the FF/UDF engagement does 
\f1\b \strokec2 not
\f2\b0 \strokec2  need to be \'93the UDF shoots first\'94. That was an earlier proposed solution, not an established requirement.\
Fridge Force's mission already gives it sufficient reason to remove UDF capabilities that could obstruct recovery and shutdown.\
The operational result required for the personal climax is that the UDF becomes 
\f1\b \strokec2 sufficiently entangled, disrupted and occupied outside
\f2\b0 \strokec2  that it cannot penetrate Sublime Point in force before 05:42.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

