\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Shakti gate\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The Elvi eventually turn their musical security-disruption capability against the 
\f1\b \strokec2 Sublime Point gate/security system
\f2\b0 \strokec2 .\
They do not need Shakti security to have classified them as \'93friendly\'94. It merely needs not to have considered the assembled stage an immediate attack until the attack actually begins.\
The exact internal reasoning of the High Elvis at that instant need not be exposited.\
The established behavioural context is sufficient:\
